Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: qemu-display (qemu-rdp)
Upstream-Contact: Marc-André Lureau <https://gitlab.com/marcandre.lureau/qemu-display>
Source: https://gitlab.com/marcandre.lureau/qemu-display
Comment: Built from qemu-display at the commit in packages/wsh-qemu-rdp/upstream.env of wsh-pve,
 fetched with git at build time, with the patches in packages/wsh-qemu-rdp/patches/. Its crates
 come from crates.io (cargo vendor at build time) and are linked statically into qemu-rdp;
 /usr/share/doc/wsh-qemu-rdp/vendored-crates.txt lists each crate, its version and the license
 its manifest gives.

